(01 How We Work and When the Fee Is Earned The business terms carriers care about, supported by precise legal definitions. 1.) Tj T*
(Relationship and authority. Carrier appoints Hermes as a limited, non-exclusive independent contractor and administrative) Tj T*
(agent. Hermes may research freight, present opportunities, negotiate within Carrier instructions, coordinate setup packets) Tj T*
(and documents, communicate with brokers, shippers, dealers, auctions, factors, and facilities, and support dispatch and) Tj T*
(invoicing. Hermes may not accept a load without Carrier approval, control drivers or safety, receive freight proceeds,) Tj T*
(re-broker freight, or act in its own name as the transporting carrier. 2. Carrier approval and operations. An "Approved Load") Tj T*
(is a load Carrier accepts by text, email, portal, recorded business call, signed rate confirmation, or conduct clearly) Tj T*
(confirming acceptance. Carrier controls equipment, drivers, routes, hours of service, maintenance, cargo, insurance, permits,) Tj T*
(taxes, claims, and compliance. Carrier may reject any opportunity and may self-dispatch or use other providers. 3.) Tj T*
(Hermes-arranged loads. A "Hermes-Arranged Load" is an Approved Load that Hermes first sourced, negotiated, booked, or) Tj T*
(materially coordinated. Unless Appendix terms say otherwise, the fee is calculated on Linehaul Revenue shown on the rate) Tj T*
(confirmation. Linehaul Revenue includes bundled transportation compensation but excludes separately stated detention,) Tj T*
(layover, TONU, lumpers, fuel advances, tolls, permits, taxes, claim payments, and pass-through reimbursements. 4. Selected) Tj T*
(billing basis. If Completed Loads is selected, the fee is earned when the load is picked up and completed and is not) Tj T*
(conditioned on when Carrier later collects from a broker or factor. If Collected Revenue is selected, the fee is earned when) Tj T*
(Carrier or its factor receives the applicable freight payment. If custom work terms are selected, the signed special terms) Tj T*
(control. A Carrier-caused cancellation after approval may be billed only if a specific cancellation or work fee is written in) Tj T*
(the commercial terms. 5. Weekly invoice and payment. Each billing week runs Monday through Saturday, Eastern Time. Hermes) Tj T*
(issues the weekly invoice on Saturday. Unless different signed terms apply, payment is due by 9:00 a.m. Eastern Time on the) Tj T*
(following Monday. Carrier must identify any disputed load and reason in writing within five business days. Undisputed amounts) Tj T*
(remain payable. Rate confirmations, PODs, settlement statements, and other records may be used to verify the calculation. 6.) Tj T*
(Protected accounts and direct customers. A "Protected Account" is a shipper, dealer, auction, fleet, customer, or direct) Tj T*
(program first introduced to Carrier or materially developed for Carrier by Hermes and identified by a written Account) Tj T*
(Protection Notice. Carrier may object within three business days with dated proof of a pre-existing active relationship.) Tj T*
(During this Agreement, the selected fee applies to all Carrier revenue from a Protected Account, regardless of booking) Tj T*
(channel. After termination, the same fee continues for twenty-four months. Carrier may work with the account; this clause) Tj T*
(preserves Hermes compensation and prohibits routing the work through an affiliate, related authority, owner, driver,) Tj T*
(employee, contractor, or another dispatcher to avoid the fee. 7. Records and verification. Carrier will promptly provide) Tj T*
(records reasonably needed to verify Hermes-Arranged Loads and Protected Account revenue. Carrier authorizes Hermes to confirm) Tj T*
(load amount, delivery, settlement, and payment status with the relevant broker, shipper, dealer, or factor. On five business) Tj T*
(days notice, Hermes may review relevant records no more than once per quarter. If an underpayment greater than five percent) Tj T*
(is found, Carrier also reimburses reasonable documented audit costs. 8. No circumvention of Hermes personnel. During the) Tj T*
(relationship and for twelve months after it ends, Carrier will not knowingly induce a Hermes employee or contractor who) Tj T*
(materially served Carrier and had direct contact with Carrier to leave Hermes and provide the same services directly. General) Tj T*
(advertisements not targeted at Hermes personnel and relationships documented before Hermes introduced the person are) Tj T*
(excluded. Available remedies are actual damages, reasonable replacement and training costs, and lawful injunctive relief-not) Tj T*
(an automatic punitive fine. Direct shipper / dealer protection Hermes may develop a direct account only as the disclosed) Tj T*
(representative of the specific Carrier. The transportation agreement and freight payment remain directly between the account) Tj T*
(and Carrier. Hermes does not accept freight in its own name or allocate that freight among carriers unless separately) Tj T*
(authorized and properly licensed.) Tj T*
