(month \(twelve percent annually\), or the maximum lawful rate if lower. After a written cure notice, Carrier must reimburse) Tj T*
(reasonable documented collection costs, court costs, and attorney fees to the extent permitted by contract and law or awarded) Tj T*
(by a court. Payments apply first to lawful costs, then interest, then the oldest invoice. No personal guaranty, UCC lien,) Tj T*
(automatic card debit, or confession of judgment is created. 12. Term and termination. This Agreement begins when signed,) Tj T*
(continues week to week, and may be ended by either party with seven calendar days written notice. Either party may) Tj T*
(immediately suspend or end services for fraud, unsafe or unlawful instructions, inactive authority, insufficient insurance,) Tj T*
