(by Hermes's proven gross negligence or willful misconduct. Hermes is not responsible for a broker, shipper, dealer, load) Tj T*
(board, factor, facility, insurer, or other third party's act, insolvency, system, or payment failure. 14. Liability limits.) Tj T*
(To the maximum extent allowed by law, neither party is liable for indirect, special, punitive, or consequential damages.) Tj T*
